findings.remediation:
Add a compute_environment_order block referencing the module's own compute environment:

  compute_environment_order {
    order               = 1
    compute_environment = aws_batch_compute_environment.batch.arn
  }

Add a lifecycle block to the resource:

  lifecycle {
    ignore_changes = [compute_resources[0].desired_vcpus]
  }

Add a retry_strategy block, e.g.:

  retry_strategy {
    attempts = 3
  }

Add a timeout block, e.g.:

  timeout {
    attempt_duration_seconds = 3600
  }
